{"3439820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Back rooms: The old Watcher", "steam_appid": 3439820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an exploration-based adventure game where you must identify anomalies and choose the correct path to progress. Set in an eerie, surreal space, you'll navigate a world inspired by Backrooms, liminal spaces, and the mysterious Exit 8. With dozens of anomalies to observe and interpret, your intuition and keen observation skills will be your greatest assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unsettling environment, subtle shifts or striking anomalies can become the key to survival. Be vigilant, as even the smallest change may hold the answer to your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over dozens of anomalies, randomly appearing to keep you on edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gameplay loop focused on observing and choosing the correct path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and eerie liminal space to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-completion feature to track and complete all anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully supported for gameplay streaming and live commentary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this strange world? Or perhaps, there is no exit for the old man after all...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an exploration-based adventure game where you must identify anomalies and choose the correct path to progress. Set in an eerie, surreal space, you'll navigate a world inspired by Backrooms, liminal spaces, and the mysterious Exit 8. With dozens of anomalies to observe and interpret, your intuition and keen observation skills will be your greatest assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unsettling environment, subtle shifts or striking anomalies can become the key to survival. Be vigilant, as even the smallest change may hold the answer to your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over dozens of anomalies, randomly appearing to keep you on edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gameplay loop focused on observing and choosing the correct path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and eerie liminal space to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-completion feature to track and complete all anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully supported for gameplay streaming and live commentary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this strange world? Or perhaps, there is no exit for the old man after all...</p>", "short_description": "This work is inspired by Exit 8, Backrooms, and liminal spaces - environments that evoke an unsettling sense of the familiar yet strange. However, is there any way out for the old man? No, there isn't.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439820/header.jpg?t=1738405649", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439820/6047bbfd3faf9b6623b92ec043081802b2d19d90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738405649", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439820/6047bbfd3faf9b6623b92ec043081802b2d19d90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738405649", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["TanuTanuGameStudio"], "publishers": ["TanuTanuGameStudio"], "price_overview":